WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
[Soft original electronic score]

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.668
A city is more than its skyline. It is a meeting point for people, memories, and ideas.

00:00:08.518 --> 00:00:15.611
Miami is the opening cultural gateway for Monumental Streams: a place to begin following those connections.

00:00:16.461 --> 00:00:25.184
This original motion study imagines those crossings as light and rhythm. It is an illustration, not a recorded performance.

00:00:26.034 --> 00:00:30.278
Explore what you love. Discover where it lives.

